# Check out every text file with LF, on every platform.
#
# The repo has always stored LF, and Prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"` checks for
# it. Git for Windows ships `core.autocrlf=true` in its system gitconfig, so
# without this file a Windows checkout gets CRLF and `npm run format:check`
# flags every file. This overrides autocrlf per repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff2 binary
